                                                "sense_id": "b9366371-6411-3fba-a2da-dbcabc91dabf",
                                                "text": "And dravving both their ſvvords vvith rage extreme, / Like tvvo mad maſtiffes each on other flevv, / And ſhields did ſhare, & mailes did raſh, and helmes did hevv."
                                            },
