                                                "example_id": "3ccea0dc-0591-4e69-8434-eb0ccbc60e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "b9366371-6411-3fba-a2da-dbcabc91dabf",
                                                "text": "[N]ovv he, comes violently on, and vvithall advancing his Rapier to ſtrike, […] Sir, I miſt my purpoſe in his arme, raſht his doublet ſleeue, ran him cloſe by the left cheeke, and through his haire: […]"
                                            }
